    <Objective>k__BackingField: Take off and gain some height.
    <Commands>k__BackingField: Hold <color=#F2FA00>Space</color> to flap your wings.
    <GamepadCommands>k__BackingField: Hold <sprite name="xbox_a" tint=0> to flap your wings.
  - <Achievement>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9785a068b06f45fcb6c51b066bc3b881, type: 2}
    <Objective>k__BackingField: Steer to change direction in flight.
    <Commands>k__BackingField: '<color=#F2FA00>Left / Right</color> arrows: turn

      <color=#F2FA00>Up / Down</color> arrows: pitch'
    <GamepadCommands>k__BackingField: '<sprite name="xbox_left_stick" tint=0> Left / right: turn

      <sprite name="xbox_left_stick" tint=0> Up / down: pitch'
  - <Achievement>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6741217f46454adab4e776a0f0eb0184, type: 2}
    <Objective>k__BackingField: Land in a mission circle and stay still to activate it.
    <Commands>k__BackingField: '<color=#F2FA00>Ctrl</color>: brake <color=#F2FA00>Space</color>: gain height

      Stay still in the circle to activate it.'
    <GamepadCommands>k__BackingField: 'Hold <sprite name="xbox_b" tint=0> to brake and land.

      Stay still in the circle to activate it.'
